      <title>伊朗称一美国F-16战机遭伊方防空系统警告射击</title>
      <link>https://mirrorinfo.xyz/?batch=smart-20261128-104132&amp;cat=general&amp;event=evt_5dffb45e21df</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261128-104132:evt_5dffb45e21df</guid>
